    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense, but I'm looking for a bit more immediate reassurance from your end. As the Prestige Estates assistant for this property, you have access to the full building maintenance logs and the most recent inspection data, right? I'd feel much better knowing that everything, especially the balcony and glasswork, is in perfect condition and fully up to code. Can you confirm there are no known issues with the exterior structure?",
